    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should probably talk to someone but it feels pointless. if the person who is supposed to be doing the talking isn't even there... what am i even saving? it's like a house is burning down but the person inside has already vanished. there's just this empty shell left. it feels like there's no point in trying to fix something that isn't even \"me\" anymore.",
